<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 16.98 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 16.98 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 16.98 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 14 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 8.49 billion schillings, or seven percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 257</p>
</text>
